Package: ImmunoPathwayR
Type: Package
Title: A Reductionist, Semi-Curated Pathway Database for Immune Gene Expression Scoring
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Author", "Name", email = "author@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides curated, bottom-up immune pathways and functions to score gene 
    expression data using GSVA and ssGSEA methods. The pathways are designed to be 
    non-redundant and clearly annotated with specific genes for each biological process.
    Scoring functions work directly with Seurat objects.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Depends: 
    R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports:
    GSVA,
    Seurat,
    methods
Suggests:
    testthat
RoxygenNote: 7.1.1
